3. Mandatory logo and visible original-creator credit
-----------------------------------------------------
In the official Software and every expressly approved fork or derivative:

  a. The BlacHammer logo must remain present, unaltered and clearly visible in the loader.
     It must not be stripped, replaced, hidden, obscured or disabled.

  b. BlacHammer must remain credited as the original creator of the loader. The official
     Discord link, https://discord.gg/qeGAX6VCUz, must remain visible and usable.

  c. An approved derivative may redesign its interface only within the written approval.
     It must preserve visible original-creator credit and the Discord link in the loader,
     or provide a clearly labeled Credits section readily accessible to every user upon
     launching it. The BlacHammer logo must still remain visibly present in the application.
     An obscure source comment or external website alone is not sufficient attribution.

  d. Approved contributors may add truthful credits for their own changes, but may not
     claim authorship of BlacHammer's original loader or remove its original-creator credit.

  e. Approved distributions must include this license and identify BlacHammer as original
     creator in their README and distribution/download page.

Attribution is mandatory, not a substitute for written fork/redistribution approval.

